# PlutoBT

Hybrid futures backtesting engine in Python. Vectorized signals + event-driven execution, realistic futures fills/margin, verified CME contract specs. MIT.

Contract specs verified against CME Group (NQ, ES, CL, GC, ZN, etc.). See `docs/superpowers/specs/`.
